      "value": "Bumping this, running into the exact same issue with VRCInputMethod.Equals returning False in game but not in ClientSim. Forgot to check Canny first though so here's a test world I put together for it: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_33dc274b-1580-4a14-90c3-19f95df26a62/info",
